#{{slang}} [[fantastic|Fantastic]], [[fabulous]], [[excellent]].

Originally coined by Robert Strom, a child contestant on the 1950s American TV show <i>The $64,000 Question,</i> the word was popularized by Van Morrison when he used it in the lyrics of his 1970 hit song <i>Moondance.</i>

